=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play logs/read-pager -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Logs screen proposed for slice 1, read$
# from a simulated host by the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s$
# to build. It only reads: no plan, no y/N, no journal. No pager$
# runs: an item says what it would run. Nothing on this machine$
# changes: every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/read-pager$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less installed. Treatment$
# read-pager, P-18 as written: the main menu's 10 runs the pager$
# at once, and returns there. A golden cannot run it: this says$
# what would run.$
$
# Note$
# The gallery runs no pager. hardn would run LESSSECURE=1 less$
# /var/log/hardn.log, then draw the main menu again.$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

